        "description": {
            "value": "<p><em>Every slot.</em> GM-permission item. Cells you were always carrying, cultured back into a body and given senses — where The Last Graft overwrites you with pieces of many donors, this is one donor who never finished being born. Darkvision, imprecise scent 30 feet, +2 item bonus to Perception from the Passenger's own independent senses. Once per day for 1 minute, the Passenger acts as a bonded second presence sharing your space — an extra skill or Aid action on your turn, no separate initiative needed.</p><p><b>Rider:</b> It isn't a tool, it's a roommate, permanently and not occasionally. It has one standing veto: once per session it can flatly refuse to let you take an action that would hurt whoever it's decided counts as \"family\" — no override, no negotiation in the moment.</p>"
